    "mlip": "Remote MLIP model metadata and training/validation settings. Keep cluster paths here; do not put model files or credentials in this JSON.",
    "supercomputer": "Remote paths and optional scheduler metadata. Leave unavailable submit/query/cancel commands unset; the agent must not guess them.",
